        "created_at": "2013-03-26T00:22:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think the only way Fanatic would be a bit buggered would be if something had prevented her from dealing damage (eg Ensnaring Brambles or Ethereal Bonds) - in that case she couldn't take the \"deal damage\" option since she can't deal damage at all, therefore the only option available is to destroy the card.</p>",
